ck request')"}]},{"step":"rho_atm_confirmed_provisional","verdict":"valid","why":"Doc 033 names the confirmed case and has credit issued immediately, and doc 032's remaining general conditions still apply.","clauses":[{"clause":"eligible true; merchant contact does not apply; conditions 1, 3, 4 still hold","kind":"derived","source":"doc 033 'If discrepancy confirmed, provisional credit is issued immediately (no waiting period)' decides the confirmed case on the bank's own record; doc 032 REQUIRED conditions 1, 3, 4 govern debit disputes generally"}]},{"step":"decide_parameters","verdict":"rewrite","why":"Its ATM amount rule (withdrawn minus received) gives zero for an unvalidated Rho-Bank claim, contradicting rho_atm_not_validated and the field definition.","clauses":[{"clause":"For an ATM cash discrepancy, disputed_amount is the amount withdrawn minus the cash received","kind":"unsupported","source":"doc 031 field 8 'The dollar amount being disputed'; when the record equals the cash received (claim not validated) the customer disputes the requested amount minus cash received (rho_atm_not_validated), and the tool rejects a non-positive amount"},{"clause":"card_action by each dispute's own category","kind":"derived","source":"doc 031 mapping + 'record each dispute's card_action based on its own category mapping'"}],"rewrite":{"id":"decide_parameters","by":"model","do":"For each dispute, set dispute_category (from choose_category), transaction_type, provisional_credit_eligible (from decide_provisional_credit) and card_action. card_action follows that dispute's own category:
